  "goodToKnow": "Der Balken is a beam: der Holzbalken, der Dachbalken. Germany's half-timbered houses (Fachwerkhäuser) show their Balken on the outside. Lügen, dass sich die Balken biegen means to lie so outrageously that the beams bend. Das Balkendiagramm is a bar chart, and in sport, der Schwebebalken is the balance beam. The biblical saying about the speck and the beam is den Balken im eigenen Auge nicht sehen. The plural is the same: die Balken."
